# M6.4 (2026-06-21, Model B): RP-resident boot-time RoT-marker module (no compute,
# mailbox publishes 0x600DB007). The board boots the static+rm_rot full so the RP
# comes up in RoT state; the measured gate passes; then loadbp swaps the same RP to
# rm_tpuvpu (-> 0x1019391F) -- the "measure-then-yield" path. Same static as M6.3
# (pr_verify: impl_1 vs impl_6 compatible), so rm_tpuvpu/rm_rot partials interswap.
